    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into <strong>Mimi\u2019s Restaurant Helper</strong>, a charming\u00a0\u00a0<strong>2D cooking game</strong> that brings the nostalgic energy of 2000s anime and flash games to life! Master the art of crafting stunning dishes, tackle engaging challenges, and dive into fun mini-games that keep the kitchen excitement flowing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6c68063305c7c2de8acea3fd8a43b85e.poster.avif?t=1749266348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6c68063305c7c2de8acea3fd8a43b85e.webm?t=1749266348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6c68063305c7c2de8acea3fd8a43b85e.mp4?t=1749266348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas, prep ingredients, fry food, clean up, take orders, and more! A fun mix of puzzles, time management, and cooking challenges in one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/a5c14792d78221e67231e39b62914d66.avif?t=1749266348\" width=250 height=103 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Support the pre-launch kickstarter campaign!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into <strong>Mimi\u2019s Restaurant Helper</strong>, a charming\u00a0\u00a0<strong>2D cooking game</strong> that brings the nostalgic energy of 2000s anime and flash games to life! Master the art of crafting stunning dishes, tackle engaging challenges, and dive into fun mini-games that keep the kitchen excitement flowing.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6c68063305c7c2de8acea3fd8a43b85e.poster.avif?t=1749266348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6c68063305c7c2de8acea3fd8a43b85e.webm?t=1749266348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/6c68063305c7c2de8acea3fd8a43b85e.mp4?t=1749266348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pizzas, prep ingredients, fry food, clean up, take orders, and more! A fun mix of puzzles, time management, and cooking challenges in one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791620/extras/a5c14792d78221e67231e39b62914d66.avif?t=1749266348\" width=250 height=103 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Support the pre-launch kickstarter campaign!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
